{"availability":"available","full":"brutall100/modal-window-demo","name":"modal-window-demo","description":"Accessible, animated modal window demo built with the native HTML <dialog>, CSS and vanilla JS. Light & dark themes.","category":"Design","language":"CSS","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2023-06-08T16:19:25Z","updated":"2026-09-23T11:57:06Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://brutall100.github.io/modal-window-demo/","topics":[],"demo":"https://brutall100.github.io/modal-window-demo/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T02:36:32.453Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T02:36:32.453Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T02:36:32.453Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T02:36:32.453Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An accessible, animated modal window built with the native HTML element, plain CSS and vanilla JavaScript.","A modal is the little window that pops up on top of a page, waits for your answer and then goes away. This project started as a tiny first try at building one. Now it is a small playground that shows three kinds of modals and how to make them feel good: smooth, easy to close and friendly to keyboard and screen reader users."],"features":["Three modal examples: a simple message, a confirm dialog and a form with validation.","Three ways to close: the × button, the Esc key or a click on the dark backdrop.","Accessible: built on and showModal(), so focus stays inside the modal and goes back to the button that opened it. It also has a \"Skip to content\" link, visible focus rings and labelled form fields.","Light and dark theme: follows your system setting, has a toggle that remembers your choice and never flashes the wrong theme while the page loads.","Pop animations: modals grow in and shrink out, buttons lift and press down with a ripple, cards rise on hover, numbers count up and sections fade in on scroll."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/brutall100/modal-window-demo/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"7185630c414c86b7ba5f06a4e2e7d6905b7ea8315dbcfa5e34fe7f7a4ba8f352","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T02:36:32.715Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T02:36:32.715Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"An accessible, animated modal window built with the native HTML element, plain CSS and vanilla JavaScript.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/brutall100/modal-window-demo/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"7185630c414c86b7ba5f06a4e2e7d6905b7ea8315dbcfa5e34fe7f7a4ba8f352","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/brutall100/modal-window-demo/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T02:36:32.716Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-23T11:57:06Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/brutall100/modal-window-demo/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T02:36:32.716Z","hash":"7185630c414c86b7ba5f06a4e2e7d6905b7ea8315dbcfa5e34fe7f7a4ba8f352","originalBytes":4363,"storedBytes":4363,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["modal","css","orange","page","text","close","theme","window","click","cream","modals","style.css","three","built","cards","dark","demo","ff6d1f","focus","fonts","license","light","live","project","top","a63c00","accent","accessible","animations","background","bash","before","button","buttons","clone","code","color","colors","custom","dialog","docs","does","element","esc","faf3e1","first","form","goes","google","index.html","it.","modal-window-demo","native","night","out","palette","pop","properties","ripple","saved","screenshot.webp","smooth","tiny","toggle","vanilla","window-shaped","a251f","about","animate","animated","animation","answer","any","asset","away.","back","backdrop","backdrop.","behind","break","bricolage","bright","browser","brutall100","build","building","c1916","call","choice","clicks.","closes","confirm","content","contrast.","count","count-up","credits","deep","deeper","dependencies","down","easy","ends.","event.target","every",